    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x15A76; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Conversion between the VVEL control-shaft angle (axis, 1/512 degree) and the command-word domain (values), read in both directions by the task. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x15a76 bound to accessor 0x58faa through literal 0x59184, accessor 0x61d46 through literal 0x62504, accessor 0x62fac through literal 0x630e4, accessor 0x66a18 through literal 0x66bd8. Read by the task FUN_00061D46 at callsites 0x623DA and 0x62444, by the resolver FUN_00062FAC at 0x63072 and 0x63086, by FUN_00058FAA at 0x58FC8 and 0x58FE8, and by FUN_00066A18 at 0x66A28 and 0x66A44 through the 16-point uint16 leaf 0x2AF88; the call at 0x623DA exchanges the roles of axis and values. JK78C reads the pair for the resolver in the separate function FUN_0005693A. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x000156FC. FUN_0005C7D4 reads a byte-identical second pair 0x0001B738 over 0x0001B718.</description>
