    <title>VVEL Duration Target - Running</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x17276; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 15 duration target of the VVEL resolver: the normal running pair. The resolver interpolates it by engine speed and scales the count by the float literal 0.005. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x17276 bound to accessor 0x62fac through literal 0x63400, accessor 0x63cd4 through literal 0x63ee0. Read by the resolver FUN_00062FAC at callsite 0x63142 and by FUN_00063CD4 at 0x63D1C through the 16-point uint16 leaf 0x2AF88; the 0.005 factor is the float literal 0x3BA3D70A at 0x63404. The resolver stores the value in pair 14 of its thirty-float output, the slot that the JK78C resolver FUN_000564A4 and the 1ND0A resolver FUN_0005F468 fill with the mode 15 pair. Stock bytes are identical to 1ND0A 0x000171C2; the unit of the scaled duration is a vendor-catalog candidate.</description>
