  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x7CE1" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Duration Target - Hot Intake Idle</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0xE17C; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 12 duration surface of the VVEL resolver: the hot-intake idle pair. The pair value is the maximum of this surface and the eight-point floor 0x000165DC, scaled by 0.05. Stock values are 1000 = 50.0 at every cell. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0xe17c bound to accessor 0x62fac through literal 0x63420. Read by the resolver FUN_00062FAC at callsite 0x63188 through the 8x8 uint16 leaf 0x29EC0 with the r7 word argument that also indexes the running CVTC curve on the first axis and a signed word argument clamped at zero in the stack slot on the second axis, the coordinate form of the JK78C surface 0x0000E1CE. The maximum goes to pair 11 of the output with the float literal 0x3D4CCCCC at 0x63428. FUN_0007448C reads the separate uniform surfaces 0x0001027C and 0x000102FC over its own axes 0x000173B6 and 0x000173A6.</description>
