    <title>VVEL Duration Target - Hot Intake Idle, Knock</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0xE1FC; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 13 duration surface of the VVEL resolver: the second hot-intake idle pair, which the JK78C selector takes in the high-detonation state. The pair value is the maximum of this surface and the eight-point floor 0x000165EC, scaled by 0.05. Stock values are 1000 = 50.0 at every cell. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0xe1fc bound to accessor 0x62fac through literal 0x6342c. Read by the resolver FUN_00062FAC at callsite 0x631BE through the 8x8 uint16 leaf 0x29EC0 with the coordinates and axes of the mode 12 surface 0x0000E17C; the maximum goes to pair 12 of the output. Stock values are identical to that surface.</description>
