  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5C22" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Command Word - Shaft Angle Conversion, Second Copy</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x1B738; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Second copy of the shaft-angle conversion, read only by FUN_0005C7D4: it converts the two measured control-shaft angle words 0xFFFE97A6 and 0xFFFE97A8 to the command-word domain and publishes the mean of the two results times 1/512 as the float 0xFFFEF1A8 for FUN_0005BB04. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x1b738 bound to accessor 0x5c7d4 through literal 0x5c974. Read by FUN_0005C7D4 at callsites 0x5C7E6 and 0x5C7FA through the 16-point uint16 leaf 0x2BCD4; the primary conversion 0x00015A76 goes through the leaf 0x2AF88. FUN_0005BB04 is the only caller and the only reader of the float. The two argument words are the measured angles that the deficit monitors FUN_000EB19A subtract from the floor maximum. Stock bytes are identical to the primary table 0x00015A76.</description>
