    <title>VVEL Shaft Angle Monitor Floor - A, Second Copy</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x1B9B8; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Second copy of monitor floor A: FUN_00066C30 interpolates it by the word 0xFFFE81B0 into 0xFFFEABA4, one of the four floor words 0xFFFEA4DE, 0xFFFEA4E0, 0xFFFEABA4, and 0xFFFEABA6 whose maximum the deficit monitors FUN_000EB19A compare with the measured control-shaft angle. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x1b9b8 bound to accessor 0x66c30 through literal 0x66c60. Read by FUN_00066C30 at callsite 0x66C3C through the 8-point uint16 leaf 0x2AEAC. No direct call reaches the reader; its entry address is the word at 0x22240 of a function-pointer list. The maximum with the primary floor words fixes the 1/512 degree domain. Stock bytes are identical to the primary table 0x0001668C.</description>
