  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xDAF2" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Duration Target - Start-up</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x163E4; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Start-up duration of the mode 2 and mode 11 pairs: the curve by a temperature byte, scaled by 0.05. With the request argument set, a weighted mix of ROM16[0x94A8] and the eight-point curve 0x00017136 replaces the curve. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x163e4 bound to accessor 0x6375e through literal 0x639e4. Read by FUN_0006375E at callsite 0x63894 through the 16-point uint16 leaf 0x2AF88; the resolver FUN_00062FAC copies the result from 0xFFFEF468 to pairs 1 and 10 of its output. With the request argument set, FUN_0006375E publishes w * ROM16[0x94A8] + (1 - w) * curve 0x00017136 over axis 0x00017186, scaled by 0.05, where the weight w moves by ROM16[0x9474] / 32768 per pass within 0..1; JK78C ramps between two ROM words instead. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00015E32.</description>
