  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1498" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Duration State Word - Hot Intake Idle</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x1027C; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration word surface of the state-code dispatcher FUN_0007448C for state code 5; FUN_00050310 assigns code 5 to VVEL mode 12, code 6 to mode 13, and code 7 to mode 14. The dispatcher evaluates the state bytes 0xFFFEB826 and 0xFFFEB8DC in turn and publishes the duration word 0xFFFE821E. Stock values are 1000 = 50.0 at every cell. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x1027c bound to accessor 0x7448c through literal 0x75244. Read by FUN_0007448C at callsites 0x750AE and 0x75176 through the 8x8 uint16 leaf 0x29EC0 with r7 = min(0xFFFF, 0xFFFE819E &lt;&lt; 2), the 12.5 RPM per count engine-speed word in the 3.125 RPM domain on the first axis and the stack coordinate the load byte 0xFFFE8034 &lt;&lt; 8, the byte that indexes the ignition mode surfaces in FUN_000797CC on the second axis. The same dispatcher takes the throttled curve 0x000173D6 for state codes 1 and 3, so the word shares the 0.05 domain of that curve. The resolver pair of modes 12 and 13 is a separate pair of surfaces with its own axes.</description>
