    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x1457A; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Delay curve of the stepped approach to the throttled duration: FUN_00063534 multiplies the value by 100 and passes it to the delay helper FUN_0002861E, which gates the offset that steps toward the curve 0x000173D6. Stock values fall from 30 at -30 degC to 0 at 40 degC. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x1457a bound to accessor 0x63534 through literal 0x637bc. Read by FUN_00063534 at callsite 0x6355C through the 8-point uint8 leaf 0x2AC9C indexed by its first byte argument, the byte that the resolver FUN_00062FAC also passes to FUN_0006375E as the start-up curve coordinate. The time weight of one count of the helper argument is not bound to a published parameter.</description>
