    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x17136; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Blend target of the start-up duration: with the request argument set, FUN_0006375E publishes w * ROM16[0x94A8] + (1 - w) * this curve, scaled by 0.05, in place of the start-up curve 0x000163E4. Stock values are 1300 = 65.0 at every point. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x17136 bound to accessor 0x6375e through literal 0x639d0. Read by FUN_0006375E at callsite 0x63866 through the 8-point uint16 leaf 0x2AEAC indexed by the low byte of its stack argument, the byte that indexes the cold duration curve 0x000170F6 in the resolver FUN_00062FAC. The weight w moves by ROM16[0x9474] / 32768 per pass within 0..1.</description>
