    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x17146; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 3 intake-cam target of the VVEL resolver, interpolated by the coolant-coded byte of the cold axis and gated by the flag 0xFFFEF5A6 with hysteresis ROM8[0x8BD3] = 53 and ROM8[0x8BD4] = 0. Stock values are 0x8000 = 0 at every point. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x17146 bound to accessor 0x62fac through literal 0x63438. Read by the resolver FUN_00062FAC at callsite 0x6322A through the 8-point uint16 leaf 0x2AEAC with its own literal pool word and the cold axis 0x00017176. The uniform stock block repeats elsewhere in the image; the binding rests on the call that follows the cold duration curve and on pair 2 of the output. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00016A94.</description>
