  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xE698" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 1 - Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut Caps</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x9266; 1 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release scalar caps. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. Exact 1ME3B native fuel-cut model at 0x7b1a0; selector 0xfffe80e5, shared axis 0x17106. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 223 targets FUN_0007b1a0, the first Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator behind periodic task-list word 0x00022144. Its 190-byte implementation preserves the 1ND cap, interpolation, activation, release, and hysteresis structure with target-local storage; the compiler packs the active and armed flags of the state byte into bits 3 and 2.</description>
