  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xB41D" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 2 - Timing-State Addend - Warm DFCO Transition - Alternate</title>
    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x13C500; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Alternate warm DFCO-transition eight-point timing-state addend. It shares the index byte and the interpolator of the projected default table 0x00013A26 and is selected when the transition-completion latch is set. Common-definition Map 2 storage is projected from 0x13A2E. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. Exact 1ME3B target-native table at 0x13a2e bound to accessor 0x7323e through literal 0x73404. Read by the coordinator FUN_0007323E at callsite 0x73378 through the implicit eight-point uint8 leaf 0x2A9F4 with the index byte 0xFFFE8194, the byte that indexes the default table 0x00013A26 at 0x73334, so neither branch carries an engine-bank identity. The selector is the latch 0xFFFEB9A4.bit2: it sets when the progress word 0xFFFEB8DA reaches ROM8[0x854E] * 256 = 0x8000 and releases below 0x8000 - ROM8[0x854F] * 256 = 0x7300. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x000137F0.</description>
