    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x13C740; 2 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release curves. Common-definition Map 5 storage is projected from 0x172B6. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. Exact 1ME3B native fuel-cut model at 0x7b1a0; selector 0xfffe80e5, shared axis 0x17106. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 223 targets FUN_0007b1a0, the first Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator behind periodic task-list word 0x00022144. Its 190-byte implementation preserves the 1ND cap, interpolation, activation, release, and hysteresis structure with target-local storage; the compiler packs the active and armed flags of the state byte into bits 3 and 2. The two rows are interpolated independently; no interpolation occurs between rows.</description>
