    <description>Exact 1ME3B. Address 0x13CF66; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Minimum normalized engine-coolant temperature required for Rolling Launch activation The runtime compares the normalized coolant index at 0xFFFF1077 against this inclusive minimum. The index maps 0, 16, ..., 240 to -40, -30, ..., 110 deg C; 255 is the saturated hot endpoint.</description>
